      "message": "oops, this is backwards. please read this page:\n\nhttp://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/5.7/en/range-optimization.html\n\nYou want user_id first so that the b-tree range algorithm can skip to the first record with user_id, and then apply b-tree ranges to the rest fo the records.",
